        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4Q1RUZHhPSHBUVDJKWVNGcFhiR0pDVUMxVmNVRRAB!2m1!1s0x340408a708a9ede3:0x8c6d8150d6ab7754"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ4-2pCKcIBDQRVHer1lCBbYw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCdU5YZHRSbE14Ukc1MGFVazJhekZKTjFOc2ExRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "三線發展商(百利保)營運，死場一個，毫無人流。\n最大賣點4樓playhouse+餐廳都執埋，得返間超市同埋地產鋪，加速死亡...\n整個無門檻免費泊車(1/2小時)可能吸引職業司機幫襯下",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "三線發展商(百利保)營運，死場一個，毫無人流。\n最大賣點4樓playhouse+餐廳都執埋，得返間超市同埋地產鋪，加速死亡...\n整個無門檻免費泊車(1/2小時)可能吸引職業司機幫襯下",
